 * the close-button and carousel values, and the component rules nested under that selector, whose
 * image-valued variables have no theme-scope light counterpart.
 *
 * The predicate is anchored at the start of the selector, which is what excludes
 * `.navbar-dark, .navbar[data-bs-theme=dark]` and its `--bs-navbar-*` declarations: that rule
 * paints a component inside a dark island rather than retuning the island itself.
